WEBVTT

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:05.988
Club Batting without Teams:
choose this match’s players.

00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:07.914
Open Choose players
for this match.

00:00:07.914 --> 00:00:11.865
Groups help you find names.
They do not select anyone.

00:00:11.865 --> 00:00:18.017
Tick the players
who are actually playing.

00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:19.954
Save match players
to confirm this match’s list.

00:00:19.954 --> 00:00:23.739
Now add your match review.

00:00:23.739 --> 00:00:29.958
Save the review.
The player list and observation stay together.
